OL,3,GNEWSAYoung, Welsh and into politics -
OL,4,Abut with different views on
OL,5,Aindependence
OL,6,
OL,7,FCerys and Patrick have a lot in common.
OL,8,FThey're both young, Welsh, and very
OL,9,Finterested in politics.
OL,11,FThe one thing they don't agree on is
OL,12,FWales' future within the United
OL,13,FKingdom.
OL,15,FA leading academic said the
OL,16,Fconversation around Welsh independence
OL,17,F"has become normalised" amongst young
OL,18,Fpeople.
